    {
      "id": "claim_34dba2d6559f44ff9c6be0f65e8ebc7c",
      "statement": "Weaviate reserves the property name `id`, so the schema uses `id_` instead; `prepare_data_for_import` bridges a legacy input field named `id` to `id_` when `id_` is absent, otherwise every imported object would silently have `id_ = None`.",
      "evidence": [
