    {
      "id": "claim_23f5e88118b0472188b2de11878bfc90",
      "statement": "`data/chunks_lipitor.json` (119 records) and `data/chunks_metformin.json` (54 records) are checked-in, offline-produced build artifacts (never written by the running app), each a single top-level JSON array whose elements share the ingestion row shape: `id_`, raw `text`, LLM-augmented `contextualized` text (the field actually embedded/searched), `metadata`, `page_numbers`, and `doc_source`.",
