    {
      "id": "claim_434a0b42abfd4d0c969ae07f896656b8",
      "statement": "Chunk artifacts are produced by `DocumentChunkProcessor`: Docling PDF conversion with OCR disabled and table structure enabled, `HybridChunker` using a MiniLM tokenizer with `max_tokens=8192` and peer merging; a post-processing pass additionally merges chunk fragments sharing the same table reference and merges adjacent same-heading sentence fragments that were split mid-sentence.",
      "evidence": [
