    {
      "id": "claim_ad535e92287f483ea7642eeb45fc29b6",
      "statement": "`make ingest` runs the loader CLI with `--delete-all`, which calls `client.collections.delete_all()` and erases every collection in the persistent Weaviate volume, not just the collections about to be reloaded; `ingest_json_to_collection(delete_existing=True)` is narrower and deletes only its own named collection before reloading it.",
