      "id": "claim_5b7dd865a724414299c74b6b42945e22",
      "statement": "Import validates only that `text` is nonempty, batches at 100 objects, stops after more than 10 batch errors, and reports only an approximate successful count, so a completed, non-crashing ingestion run can still leave a partially loaded collection without failing loudly.",
