    {
      "id": "claim_9e2609d8a4954365a8f49c022c39188e",
      "statement": "When the merged retrieval has no documents at all (routing failure, empty hybrid-search hits, or exhausted retries), `evaluate_retrieval` short-circuits to `is_sufficient=True` without invoking the judge LLM, and `generate_answer` separately short-circuits to a fixed \"I'm sorry, I don't know the answer to that question.\" string without calling the generation model or `AnswerValidator`.",
